    skos:definition "the fruit of *Pimpinella anisum*, very generally used as a condiment in the East, and in Europe for essential oil, for flavouring in medicine, &c.; star anise, the capsule and seeds of *Illicium anisatum*, constitutes an important article of commerce in the Eastern bazaars, and is imported into this country. [P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 24]"@en ;
